sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Gateway as Gateway
    participant Orders as Order Service
    participant Rating as Rating service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Orders->>Rating: GET /api/v1/rating/{userId}, on create and accept
    Rating->>DB: user_rating row for userId
    Rating-->>Orders: 200 userId, average or null, count

    User->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/rating/{userId}
    Gateway->>Rating: same path
    Rating-->>User: 200 userId, average or null, count

    User->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/rating/me/pending
    Gateway->>Rating: same path, x-user-id
    Rating->>DB: caller's rating_grant rows not rated and not skipped
    Rating-->>User: 200 pending, oldest grant first
